  "citation": "Agarwal D; Cholia S; Hendrix V C; Crystal-Ornelas R; Snavely C; Damerow J; Varadharajan C (2022): ESS-DIVE Reporting Format for Dataset Package Metadata. Environmental Systems Science Data Infrastructure for a Virtual Ecosystem (ESS-DIVE). Dataset. doi:10.15485/1866026",
