    "measurementTechnique": [
      "Work on the ESS-DIVE dataset metadata reporting format began with a review of existing metadata standards and other data resources. The goal in developing this format was to incorporate existing standards as much as possible to enable portability with other data architectures. The review included 5 existing standards including Ecological Metadata Language (https://eml.ecoinformatics.org/) and JSON-LD (https://json-ld.org/).\nIn order to ensure that ESS-DIVE\u2019s dataset metadata reporting format serves the needs of both data collectors as well as data reusers, ESS-DIVE held a series of community presentations and 1:1 discussions to receive input on the in-progress reporting format."
    ],
